 background is a breeze!)\r\n\r\nVideo to live on your background and lockscreen\r\nThe video downloader lets you download your favorite TikTok and convert them into wallpapers & backgrounds for your lock screen within minutes.\r\n\r\n\u25cfAnime scenes\r\n\u25cfMusic videos\r\n\u25cfPhoto reels\r\n\u25cfAnimal clips\r\n\u25cfSports highlights\r\n\u25cfHilarious pranks\r\nAnd so much more..\r\n\r\nWhatever you desire, find it on TikTok, download it with the video downloader, and set it as your wallpapers & lock screen - that's video to live wallpaper within minutes!\r\n\r\nSo whenever you tap your password into your lock screen, your live wallpaper starts playing your favorite TikTok\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude0d\r\n\r\nWe know you'll love the TikTok Live Wallpapers app. And we'd love to hear your feedback!\r\nTikTok Live Wallpaper was designed to be simple and easy to use. You're sure to have a blast switching and changing your wallpaper backgrounds (remember, the video downloader can download as many videos as you'd like!)\r\n\r\nVideo to live wallpaper has never been easier. But if you happen to have any issues, need some support, or have some feedback, please message us at feedback@tiktok.com or tweet us @tiktok\r\n\r\nJoin thousands of others and download the TikTok Live Wallpapers app today!\r\nRemember, downloading our TikTok Live Wallpaper app takes less than two minutes.\r\n\r\nWith it, you can transform your lock screen and backgrounds with your favorite TikTok live wallpaper (anything from anime, music, dance, comedy, sports... Whatever you like!)\r\n\r\nJoin the fun today, find your favorite TikTok, and make it your new live wallpaper background within minutes - It's a blast to do with you and your friends. Oh, and it's way more exciting than a background photo!\r\n\r\nSo go ahead. Download TikTok Live Wallpapers today!",
